# The renamed file deleted: the test station has no trash for the drive, so it asks first (删除「…」？) and deletes it
# for good (where a station has one it goes to its trash at once, said so: the fixture's tests check that).
#env MBUI_OPEN_PAGE=files
timeout 90000
until =e2e-{T}
tap =e2e-{T}
until 照片-{T}.jpg
wait 500
hold 900 照片-{T}.jpg
until 已选 1 项
tap icon:more
until 复制路径
shot 1-sheet
tap icon:trash
until 删除「照片-{T}.jpg」？
shot 2-asked
tap =删除
gone 照片-{T}.jpg
shot 3-deleted
